  {
   "SurveyID": "SV_demo",
   "Element": "SQ",
   "PrimaryAttribute": "QID7",
   "SecondaryAttribute": "treat_text",
   "Payload": {
    "QuestionID": "QID7",
    "DataExportTag": "treat_text",
    "QuestionText": "<p>Please read the following paragraph carefully. Economists at major universities report that immigrants start new businesses at twice the rate of native-born Americans, filling jobs in agriculture, construction, and health care that would otherwise go unfilled, and contributing more in taxes over their lifetimes than they receive in benefits.</p>",
    "QuestionType": "DB",
    "Selector": "TB",
    "Configuration": {
     "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
    },
    "Language": []
   }
  },
  {
   "SurveyID": "SV_demo",
   "Element": "SQ",
   "PrimaryAttribute": "QID8",
   "SecondaryAttribute": "control_text",
   "Payload": {
    "QuestionID": "QID8",
    "DataExportTag": "control_text",
    "QuestionText": "<p>Please read the following paragraph carefully. The U.S. Census Bureau reports that the population of the United States is about 335 million people, spread across 50 states and the District of Columbia. The most populous state is California and the least populous is Wyoming.</p>",
    "QuestionType": "DB",
    "Selector": "TB",
    "Configuration": {
     "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
    },
    "Language": []
   }
  },
  {
   "SurveyID": "SV_demo",
